    "q-90531": {
      "dom_id": "step-q90531",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "Given that $X$ is a continuous random variable with the following probability density function, compute $\\text{Var}[X].$ \n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4}{{x}^{5}},\\, & x\\ge 1, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ we can calculate the variance using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]=\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2}\n$$\n\n \n\nFirst, we compute $\\text{E}[X]:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & ={\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }x\\cdot \\frac{4}{{x}^{5}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }\\frac{4}{{x}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={(-\\frac{4}{3{x}^{3}})|}_{1}^{\\infty } \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThen, we compute $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }{x}^{2}\\frac{4}{{x}^{5}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }\\frac{4}{{x}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={(-\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}})|}_{1}^{\\infty } \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the variance is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X] & =\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2} \\\\  & =2-{(\\frac{4}{3})}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-90531-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{2}{9}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"21\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
